<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Premium Plans — ImagineAI</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Choose the ImagineAI plan that fits you — start free with 5 videos, or go Monthly, Yearly or Lifetime for unlimited AI image-to-video creation.">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🎬</text></svg>">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ===== Preloader ===== -->
  <div id="preloader">
    <div class="loader-ring"></div>
    <div class="loader-text grad-text">ImagineAI</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== Navbar ===== -->
  <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a href="index.html" class="logo">
        <span class="logo-mark">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l1.9 5.8L19.7 9.7l-5.8 1.9L12 17.4l-1.9-5.8L4.3 9.7l5.8-1.9L12 2z"/><path d="M19 15l.9 2.6L22.5 18.5l-2.6.9L19 22l-.9-2.6-2.6-.9 2.6-.9L19 15z"/></svg>
        </span>
        Imagine<span class="grad-text">AI</span>
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="services.html">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="premium.html">Premium</a></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        <span class="plan-badge free">Free — 5 videos left</span>
        <a href="premium.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Upgrade</a>
        <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Open menu"><span></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ===== Page Hero ===== -->
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="grid-pattern"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:2">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Premium Plans</span>
      <h1 class="reveal d-1">Unlock <span class="grad-text">Unlimited Videos</span></h1>
      <p class="page-sub reveal d-2">
        Start free with 5 videos, or go Premium from just ₹399/month.
        Grab the launch offer on the Yearly plan and get 1 year free.
      </p>
      <div class="breadcrumb reveal d-3">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Premium</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ===== Pricing ===== -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- ===== Launch Offer ===== -->
      <div class="offer-banner reveal" data-offer-banner>
        <div class="offer-copy">
          <h3>🎁 Launch Offer — <span class="hl">1 Year FREE on ₹499/Year Plan</span></h3>
          <p>Buy the <b>₹499 Yearly plan</b> before <b>25 September 2026</b> and get 12 extra months free — 2 years of unlimited image-to-video creation. Offer ends in:</p>
        </div>
        <div class="offer-countdown" data-offer-countdown>
          <div class="cd-box"><span class="cd-num days">--</span><span class="cd-lbl">Days</span></div>
          <div class="cd-box"><span class="cd-num hrs">--</span><span class="cd-lbl">Hours</span></div>
          <div class="cd-box"><span class="cd-num mins">--</span><span class="cd-lbl">Mins</span></div>
          <div class="cd-box"><span class="cd-num secs">--</span><span class="cd-lbl">Secs</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <!-- Free -->
        <div class="price-card reveal">
          <div class="price-name">Free</div>
          <div class="price-desc">Perfect for trying ImagineAI</div>
          <div class="price-tag">
            <span class="cur">₹</span><span class="amt">0</span><span class="per">forever</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>5 free videos</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>5 motion presets</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>SD 480p output</li>
            <li class="off"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>No 1080p HD</li>
            <li class="off"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>No commercial license</li>
            <li class="off"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>No API access</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" data-buy="free">Start Free</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Monthly -->
        <div class="price-card reveal d-1">
          <div class="price-name">Monthly</div>
          <div class="price-desc">Flexible — cancel anytime</div>
          <div class="price-tag">
            <span class="cur">₹</span><span class="amt">399</span><span class="per">/month</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Unlimited videos</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>All 5 motions + priority queue</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>1080p HD output</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>60fps smooth rendering</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Commercial license included</li>
            <li class="off"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg>No API access</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" data-buy="monthly">Get Monthly</button>
          <p class="price-note">Billed monthly · Cancel anytime</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Yearly (launch offer) -->
        <div class="price-card popular reveal d-2">
          <span class="popular-flag">★ Best Value</span>
          <span class="save-badge" data-offer-banner>SAVE 50%</span>
          <div class="price-name">Yearly</div>
          <div class="price-desc">Best value — launch offer active</div>
          <div class="price-tag">
            <span class="old" data-offer-banner>₹999</span>
            <span class="cur">₹</span><span class="amt">499</span><span class="per">/year</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Unlimited videos</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Everything in Monthly</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>1080p HD output</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>60fps smooth rendering</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Commercial license included</li>
            <li class="gold" data-offer-banner><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>🎁 12 months FREE with launch offer</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" data-buy="yearly">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8l4 4 5-7 5 7 4-4-2 12H5L3 8z"/></svg>
            Get Yearly
          </button>
          <p class="price-note">≈ ₹42/mo · One-time payment</p>
          <div class="offer-line" data-offer-banner>🎁 Buy before 25 Sept → 1 year FREE (2 years total)</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Lifetime -->
        <div class="price-card lifetime reveal d-3">
          <span class="lifetime-flag">★ Lifetime Deal</span>
          <div class="price-name">Lifetime</div>
          <div class="price-desc">Pay once — own it forever</div>
          <div class="price-tag">
            <span class="cur">₹</span><span class="amt">999</span><span class="per">one-time</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Unlimited videos forever</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Everything in Yearly</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>4K video upscaling + batch render</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Full API access (10K calls)</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Team seats (up to 5)</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Early access + 24/7 priority support</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" data-buy="lifetime">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg>
            Get Lifetime
          </button>
          <p class="price-note">One-time payment · Never pay again</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust -->
      <div class="trust-bar reveal">
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="tb-ico">🛡️</span> 7-Day Money-Back Guarantee</div>
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="tb-ico">🔒</span> Secure Checkout</div>
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="tb-ico">⚡</span> Instant Activation</div>
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="tb-ico">🎧</span> 24/7 Support</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pay-methods">
        <span>🔐 Secure payments via</span>
        <span class="pay-pill">UPI</span>
        <span class="pay-pill">Visa</span>
        <span class="pay-pill">Mastercard</span>
        <span class="pay-pill">RuPay</span>
        <span class="pay-pill">Paytm</span>
        <span class="pay-pill">Google Pay</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== Comparison ===== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Compare Plans</span>
        <h2>Every Detail, <span class="grad-text">Side by Side</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-wrap reveal">
        <table class="compare-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Features</th>
              <th>Free</th>
              <th>Monthly</th>
              <th class="col-popular">Yearly <span class="mini-badge">Popular</span></th>
              <th>Lifetime</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Videos</td><td>5 total</td><td class="yes">Unlimited</td><td class="col-popular yes">Unlimited</td><td class="yes">Unlimited</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Motion presets</td><td>5</td><td class="yes">5 + priority</td><td class="col-popular yes">5 + priority</td><td class="yes">5 + early access</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Max resolution</td><td>SD 480p</td><td class="yes">1080p HD</td><td class="col-popular yes">1080p HD</td><td class="yes">4K upscale</td></tr>
            <tr><td>60fps rendering</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="yes">✓</td><td class="col-popular yes">✓</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Batch rendering</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="col-popular no">✕</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Commercial license</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="yes">✓</td><td class="col-popular yes">✓</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr>
            <tr><td>API access</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="col-popular no">✕</td><td class="yes">✓ 10K calls</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Team seats</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="no">✕</td><td class="col-popular no">✕</td><td class="yes">✓ up to 5</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Support</td><td>Community</td><td class="yes">Priority email</td><td class="col-popular yes">Priority email</td><td class="yes">24/7 priority</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Price</td><td>₹0</td><td class="yes">₹399/mo</td><td class="col-popular yes">₹499/yr</td><td class="yes">₹999 once</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Questions? <span class="grad-text">Answered.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item reveal">
          <button class="faq-q">
            How does the launch offer work?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Buy the ₹499 Yearly plan before 25 September 2026 and we'll add 12 extra months of unlimited creation absolutely free — you get 24 months for the price of 12. The offer activates automatically with your purchase.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal d-1">
          <button class="faq-q">
            How does the free plan work?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Free users get 5 videos to explore ImagineAI — no credit card required. Once you use them, simply upgrade to Monthly, Yearly or Lifetime to keep creating without limits.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal d-1">
          <button class="faq-q">
            Can I cancel my subscription anytime?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. Cancel in one click from your account page and keep your benefits until the end of the billing period. No lock-ins, no cancellation fees.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal d-2">
          <button class="faq-q">
            Who owns the videos I create?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>You do — 100%. Every video you create is fully yours. Monthly, Yearly and Lifetime plans include a commercial license so you can use your videos in products, merch, ads and client work.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal d-3">
          <button class="faq-q">
            What payment methods do you accept?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>We accept all major credit and debit cards, UPI, net banking and popular wallets. Payments are processed securely — we never store your card details.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal d-4">
          <button class="faq-q">
            Can I upgrade my plan later?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes! Upgrade from Monthly to Yearly or Lifetime anytime — we'll prorate your payment so you only pay the difference. Downgrades are just as easy and take effect at the next billing cycle.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item reveal d-5">
          <button class="faq-q">
            Do you offer refunds?
            <span class="f-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — a 7-day money-back guarantee on all plans. If ImagineAI isn't for you, email us within 7 days of purchase for a full refund, no questions asked.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== CTA ===== -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-banner reveal-zoom">
        <h2>Your Images Deserve to <span class="grad-text">Keep Moving</span></h2>
        <p>Buy the <b>₹499 Yearly plan</b> before 25 September and get <b>12 months of unlimited creation FREE</b>. Instant activation · 7-day money-back guarantee.</p>
        <a href="#top" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="ctaBuy" data-buy="yearly">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8l4 4 5-7 5 7 4-4-2 12H5L3 8z"/></svg>
          Unlock Yearly — ₹499
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

